Independent review of physical Plan execution coordination extraction. The Plan package now owns execution/fallback/review ordering; CLI binds typed host effects. This increment preserves existing behavior. Plan selection/approval and callback presentation remain explicit next work, not claimed extracted. Review before/after and tests for migration regressions, boundary mistakes, disabled execution paths and inherited defects. Distinguish those categories. No tools available. Verify claims from supplied source; do not approve the full release.

